{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22276","headline":"咏怀 · 白居易","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔爲凤合郎，今爲二千石。\n自觉不如今，人言不如昔。\n昔虽居近密，终日多忧惕。\n有诗不敢吟，有酒不敢吃。\n今虽在疎远，竟岁无牵役。\n饱食坐终朝，长歌醉通夕。\n人生百年内，疾速如过隙。\n先务身安闲，次要心欢适。\n事有得而失，物有损而益。\n所以见道人，观心不观迹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}